  <p>3. Saubat bhi ummat ki khatir guzari<br> sahe tanz ke teer aur sang baari<br> magar teri himmat ke himmat na haari<br> Mohammad mohammad..(2)<br> hua tujhse islam ka bolbala<br> Mohammad mohammad..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Abuzar ho salman ho ya ho qambar<br> sabhi ke saware hai tune muqaddar<br> azane bilali ka mehwar tera ghar<br> Mohammad mohammad..(2)<br> tere wasf aql e bashar se hai baala<br> Mohammad mohammad..(4)</p> 
