  <p>6. Tere dil pe utra hai quran saara<br> ke jisse zamane ko tune sawara<br> tera qaul sadiq hai duniya me baara<br> Mohammad mohammad..(2)<br> tera ek humnaam hai aane wala<br> Mohammad mohammad..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Zamane ne kya kya na tohmat lagai<br> tere khoo ki pyasi thi saari khudai<br> magar shamme tauheed tune jalai<br> Mohammad mohammad..(2)<br> zamane ko mushkil se tune nikala<br> Mohammad mohammad..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Zamane ki tujhse adawat bhi dekhi<br> magar humne teri mohabbat bhi dekhi<br> nawase se teri ye nisbat bhi dekhi<br> Mohammad mohammad..(2)<br> teri kaali kamli alam uska kaala<br> Mohammad mohammad..(4)</p> 
